msgstr "使用更轻量的睡眠模式，让部分 ASUS 笔记本在唤醒后 Fn 键仍可使用。挂起期间会稍微多耗一些电量。"

# File: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/sleep_page.py, line: 91
#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/sleep_page.py:188
msgid ""
"S3 deep sleep can cause the Embedded Controller to stop generating hotkey "
"interrupts. s2idle keeps the EC powered, avoiding this issue at a small cost "
"in battery consumption."
msgstr "S3深度睡眠可能导致嵌入式控制器停止生成热键中断。s2idle保持EC供电，以较小的电池消耗避免此问题。"

